WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.660
Work hard, you two!

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.590
We will.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:08.330
Catarina, remember to mind 
your manners at school.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:12.460
Don't lift up your skirt, 
eat food off of the floor,

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.790
or throw your toys, even accidentally.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.790
And don't be noisy late at night—

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.920
I-I'll be fine, Mother.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.450
We're going now!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.300
Sister!

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.900
Goodbye, then.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.450
Good luck.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.430
<i>The time has finally come.</i>

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:47.300
<i>Here at this magic academy 
is where the game begins.</i>

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.370
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.200
<b>Episode 4 
I Enrolled in the Magic Academy...</b>

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.570
Right this way, please.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.400
It's beautiful.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.540
I'll bring the rest of your things.

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.000
Okay, thank you.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:38.180
<i>This is where the otome game 
</i>Fortune Lover<i> is set.</i>

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.100
<i>The game's heroine should be here, too.</i>

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.850
<i>Most people with magic have noble lineage,</i>

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.470
<i>but she's a commoner.</i>

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.640
<i>On top of that, she has 
very rare light magic.</i>

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.800
<i>The extraordinary Maria.</i>

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.620
<i>Whether I meet my doom or not depends on</i>

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.490
<i>how romance develops between her 
and the four conquerable characters.</i>

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.910
So it has begun at last.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.960
Yes, but many things in the past seven 
years have differed from the game.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.870
Let's review the information we have.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.370
First is Geordo Stuart.

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:20.510
In the game, Geordo has no 
interest in Catarina at all...

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:24.410
But now, he and Catarina get along great!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:28.520
But I wonder why he still won't 
break off the engagement...

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:33.600
My wound has healed, so you don't 
have to take responsibility anymore.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:36.830
You can break off the engagement.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.350
The wound hasn't healed.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.810
I will never break off our engagement.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:48.240
Catarina is nothing more to Geordo 
than an excuse to turn down other women!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.830
The way he grew into a beautiful, 
dark-hearted prince is just like the game.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.960
Second is our adopted brother, Keith.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.150
As a result of our efforts,

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.680
he grew up to be not a frivolous 
playboy, but a fine young man.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.680
Though he's grown quite handsome lately,

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.760
so he's unconsciously turning 
into a playboy anyway.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.000
Third is Alan Stuart.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.030
His inferiority complex toward his 
twin brother Geordo was resolved,

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.730
and his musical talent has blossomed.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:18.290
And unlike in the game, his fiancée, 
Mary, isn't attracted to him.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.770
Fourth is Nicol Ascart.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.480
He remains silent and expressionless,

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:26.370
but his devilish allure 
is even more powerful.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.960
We even made friends 
with his little sister, Sophia!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:34.540
Just how will these changes 
affect future events?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.590
I don't know, but our only option 
is to move forward!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.540
Yeah!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:45.800
This academy is the largest 
in the Kingdom of Sorcier.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.970
We have our own Department of Magic 
for the research of magic,

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.350
and students who achieve superior marks

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:56.430
are permitted to join 
the Department of Magic after graduation.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.280
<i>The game's heroine should be here, too.</i>

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.080
You will spend the next
 two years studying here

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.040
to better yourselves as well as this kingdom,

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.190
Is something wrong?

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:02.890
Oh, um, no...

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.850
and learning how to use magic properly.

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:03.880
Oh, that's right.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.210
Why don't you come to my room after this?

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.240
I have some unusual sweets.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:09.690
Okay.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:13.580
Next, we will hear from 
the student council president.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.740
I'd like to congratulate you all 
on your acceptance to this academy.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:21.340
I'm the student council 
president, Sirius Dieke.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:27.360
I'm sure there will be things 
that worry or confuse you at first,

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:30.860
but if you need anything, 
the student council is here to support you.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:34.490
Let's work together to make our 
time here both fun and meaningful.

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:42.620
Welcome.

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.030
Thanks for having me.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.280
And me!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:50.660
Why did you come along with her, Keith?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:55.300
I asked our servant to inform me immediately 
if anything happened to my sister.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:58.090
I wasn't expecting you 
to make a move so soon.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.190
Don't you think you're taking 
your meddling a bit far?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.750
Prince Geordo, can I really eat these?

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:10.240
Of course. I got them just for you.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.120
I'll dig in, then!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.030
Delicious!

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:23.610
By the way, I met a girl 
here who has light magic.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.740
Oh, yes, the girl all the students 
have been talking about.

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:30.830
Yes. She seemed to be lost,

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:32.950
so I saw her to her dorm.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:39.060
<i>Th-That was the first meeting 
between Geordo and the game's heroine!</i>

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.960
Geordo

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.960
You're climbing a tree dressed like that?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.960
You must be quite a tomboy.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:49.840
Maria

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:49.840
I got lost, so I thought I'd try 
to see where I was from up high.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:54.010
Geordo

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:54.010
I see. You were lost.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.010
In that case, I'll see you to your dorm.

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:56.730
<i>This really is unfolding just like the game.</i>

00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:00.680
<i>That encounter makes Geordo 
take interest in the heroine,</i>

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.690
<b>Romance Flag</b>

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.150
<i>and pretty soon, 
he'll fall in love with her!</i>

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:08.530
So there are other girls besides 
my sister who climb trees in skirts?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:12.940
I'm used to seeing that by now, 
so I wasn't too surprised,

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:15.290
but she seemed quite flustered.

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:17.640
I suppose anyone would be.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.210
My sister, on the other hand...

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.920
Catarina is certainly an exception.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.960
I find that part of her charming, though.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:27.460
<i>After Geordo falls for the heroine,</i>

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:34.550
<i>Catarina, who he only got engaged 
to out of necessity, becomes a hindrance...</i>

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.870
Are you listening, Catarina?

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.540
She's not listening at all.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:42.110
<i>I can't believe Geordo's on the verge 
of being conquered right after enrolling here.</i>

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.750
<i>They say falling in love changes people,</i>

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.320
<i>so there's no telling what'll happen.</i>

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.590
<i>I can't let my guard down.</i>

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.260
So today's the first day of classes.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.090
Yes, so it is.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:57.010
Oh, that's right.

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:00.910
I met the girl with light magic 
that Prince Geordo mentioned.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:03.000
Wh-Wh-Wha—

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:06.210
S-Sister? What's wrong?

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:10.190
<i>In the game, Keith and the heroine 
meet when he hits on her!</i>

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:11.930
Did you hit on her?!

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:14.710
Wh-What? "Hit on" her?

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:16.380
Um...

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:20.050
It means to talk a girl into 
doing immoral things, I guess...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:24.400
I-Immoral things?!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.520
You know I would never do that!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:29.040
Then how did you meet her?

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:32.440
She dropped her handkerchief, 
so I picked it up for her!

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.940
A handkerchief?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.330
<i>After failing to pick up the heroine,</i>

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.830
<i>Keith picks up her handkerchief 
and goes after her again!</i>

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:45.460
Keith

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:45.460
This is yours, right?

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.460
If you want it back, have some fun with me.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.400
What happened to the handkerchief?!

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.670
I just gave it back to her.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.460
I see...

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.180
Tell me... What was she like?

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.100
What was...

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.860
She was just a nice girl.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.720
She thanked me politely and everything.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:03.400
Not that, Keith! That's not what I'm asking!

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:04.190
Huh?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:06.680
Did you fall in love with her?!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.210
Fall in l-l-l-l-love?!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:13.280
Wh-Wh-What... d-do you...

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.940
<i>That shocked reaction... 
I hit the nail on the head.</i>

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.560
So I was right. 
You're already in love with her.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.800
Sister... Seriously,
what are you talking about?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.920
It's fine. You don't need to hide it.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.540
There's just one thing I want to tell you...

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.730
That I have no intention of getting 
between you and the girl you love!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.630
I'll be cheering you on!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:40.090
I won't get in the way!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.550
Huh? Keith?

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:45.100
Lady Catarina, I think you've done enough.

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.180
Master Keith clearly can't take any more.

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:56.250
<i>First it was Geordo, and now it looks 
like Keith's about to be conquered...</i>

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:24.490
<i>The game's heroine, Maria Campbell.</i>

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:32.810
Magic is divided into five types: 
water, fire, earth, wind, and light.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.300
It is crucial to understand 
your own magical attribute

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.770
and learn how to handle it effectively.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.240
Now, open your textbooks.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:49.170
Miss Claes, please open your textbook.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.650
Pay attention during class!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.190
Y-Yes, sir!

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.000
Lady Catarina, is something wrong?

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:07.700
Huh?

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.190
If you feel unwell, just say so.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.780
I'll look after you day and night.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:15.970
Thanks... but I'm fine.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.190
Sophia.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.660
Brother!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.240
How's school? Are you getting used to it?

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.380
Yes.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:25.610
I'm in the same dorm and the same 
classes as Lady Catarina and Lady Mary,

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.450
so I'm having a lot of fun!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.560
I see.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:32.020
We're only separated in our practical class.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.960
I can't use anything but my Earth Bump,

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.180
even though Keith can make earth dolls 
and even move them...

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:41.340
Don't worry. Everyone's magic is different.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:45.790
I have wind magic, the same as my brother,

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.060
but I can't use it as skillfully as he can.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.370
Really?

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.610
Mary, you have water magic, 
just like Prince Alan, right?

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:59.070
Yes, but I've never seen 
Prince Alan use magic.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.250
I've never seen Prince 
Geordo use magic, either.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.280
I heard he has fire magic, but...

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:07.490
Royals don't use their magic carelessly.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.080
<i>He killed me with a sword in the game, too...</i>

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:14.450
<i>Wait! This is no time to be so carefree!</i>

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.890
<i>Maria is incredibly attractive.</i>

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:20.510
<i>It's only a matter of time 
before Geordo falls for her!</i>

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.680
We will now commence this 
meeting to discuss our strategy

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.180
for avoiding the doom ending.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.750
Miss Maria is more charming than I imagined.

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.980
It's true that Maria is super attractive,

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.310
but it's not like Mary 
and Sophia are any worse!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.320
Sophia and Mary, two of the heroine's rivals,

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.610
are both smart and proficient in magic.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.250
They're both gorgeous, too!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:44.780
Maria can't beat them that easily!

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:49.320
If she could beat anyone, it's Catarina, 
who's short on both brains and magic!

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:50.920
Yes, exactly!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.660
What a relief...

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.580
That's not a relief at all!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.770
If Catarina loses to her, it's all over!

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.080
We'll be on a one-way path 
to the doom ending!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.090
Catarina loses to
the heroine
↓↓↓
HAPPY END
and Catarina is doomed

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.090
That's right! We don't <i>want</i> to lose!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.320
What do we do?!

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:04.260
What do we do?! What do we do?!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.260
Let's raise a farm.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.600
A farm?

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.830
In case we end up being exiled,

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.460
we should gain experience in farming

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:16.020
in order to get by as a farmer.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:20.410
Then we will focus on farming henceforth.

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.900
Are we in agreement?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.400
No objections!

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.820
Lady Catarina...

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.960
This is the flower garden, is it not?

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:33.870
Yes, it is.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.170
I got the school's permission.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:42.020
But, Lady Catarina, those don't 
look like flower seedlings.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.180
What are you talking about, Anne?

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:48.140
These will grow cucumber flowers, 
and these will grow eggplant flowers.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.090
In other words, they're 
vegetable seedlings...

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.490
Well, yes, they will 
ultimately grow into vegetables,

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.470
but before that, they'll grow flowers!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:14:01.190
Please take care not to let 
the school find out this is a farm.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.650
Lady Catarina!

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.450
We're going to have a tea party with—

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.920
S-Sister...

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.630
Catarina...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.000
You're still messing 
with that stuff, even here?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.310
That look suits you.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:21.500
Yes, it puts the mind at ease.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.040
Really? Thanks!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:29.130
<i>It's a rule at this school that the students</i>

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:32.800
<i>who score high on tests 
join the student council.</i>

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.590
<i>Just like in the game, as expected,</i>

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.810
<b>1st       Geordo Stuart</b>

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.810
<b>2nd      Maria Campbell</b>

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.810
<b>3rd      Alan Stuart</b>

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:36.810
<i>Geordo and his brother earned top scores.</i>

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.460
Geordo placed highest in the school, huh?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.070
And you came in third, Prince Alan.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.390
You're both fantastic.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:46.820
How'd you do?

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:50.620
I'm 80th. As average as they come!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:52.780
Uh... I see.

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:55.490
And Maria Campbell is second...

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:59.150
<i>In the game, Alan sees Maria 
as a rival after she tops his score</i>

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:01.980
<i>and picks fights with her.</i>

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:04.630
<i>And once he falls in love with her...</i>

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:10.800
Um, are you unhappy with your rank?

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:14.810
No. I don't really care 
about winning or losing.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.730
People have things they're good at 
and things they're bad at,

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.770
so there's no point in worrying 
about every little thing.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:26.610
Anyway, one of the teachers suggested 
I play a recital here at school.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:27.360
What do you think?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.500
That sounds great!

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:32.070
A lot of people look forward 
to hearing you play.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.050
Would you...

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.470
Do you want to hear it, too?

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:40.280
Huh? Yes, of course!

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:42.330
Okay.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.420
Then, I'll put on a recital.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:54.640
<b>Student Council Office</b>

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:53.540
<i>My friends joining the student council 
was just like in the game.</i>

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.550
<i>What was different about it</i>

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:59.180
<i>was that I started going to 
the student council office a lot, too.</i>

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.600
Thank you for the tea.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:09.050
I'm not interrupting your work, am I?

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.600
No, not at all.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:15.660
Since the first-years joined, 
my work is much easier, anyway.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:20.620
Speaking of, you and Master Nicol 
are the only second-years, right?

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.290
Yes. There were more of us before,

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.040
He's mine!

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:26.620
but they kept getting into fights over Nicol.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.000
No, he's mine!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.630
Like hell! He's mine!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:30.670
<i>Nicol's devilish charm 
is in full swing here, too.</i>

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.370
I'll be working over there.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.400
Let me know if you need anything.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.810
Okay, thank you.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:41.430
<i>Since the president welcomes me so warmly,</i>

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:44.140
<i>I've found myself spending 
a lot more time here.</i>

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.620
<i>And, of course,</i>

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:50.020
<i>that leads to interactions 
with the other council members...</i>

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.440
Lady Claes...

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:54.860
Please help yourself to these, if you'd like.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.390
Thank you, Miss Campbell.

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:04.210
<i>Maria-chan's such a nice, sweet girl!</i>

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.780
I'll have some, then.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.850
These are delicious!

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:14.090
They were a gift given 
to the student council.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:17.550
By the way, do you ever bring 
any of the sweets you make?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.470
Huh?

00:17:22.690 --> 00:17:24.270
<i>Wait, did I just...</i>

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.890
Make some sweets for me!

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>...make that sound like a threat?!</i>

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.160
U-Um, that is...

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:34.580
I don't mean to force you 
into making them or anything...

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:41.040
Um... How did you know that I make sweets?

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:43.440
U-Uh...

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.500
<i>I can't tell her I saw it in a game!</i>

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.550
I think I heard it from one 
of the cooks in the cafeteria...

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.410
Oh, so that's it.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:57.260
I do borrow the school's kitchen 
to make sweets sometimes.

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:01.600
But I don't make anything good 
enough to serve the council...

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:04.330
I do like high-class sweets,

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:06.480
but I love homemade ones, too!

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.410
What? You do?

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:09.140
Yes!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:13.480
The head maid at my mansion used to 
make sweets for me all the time.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:20.450
I've been missing the taste 
of those sweets since I came here...

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.950
Oh, I see.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.650
If you don't mind,

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:27.010
I'd be really happy 
if you'd share a few with me...

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.270
Okay.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.260
I don't know if you'll like them,

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:33.050
but I'll make some for you sometime.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.190
Thanks!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:41.590
I've waited so long to eat 
Maria-chan's homemade sweets!

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:44.170
Hm? What's this?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:49.400
Something smells delightfully 
fragrant and delicious...

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.310
It's coming from over there!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.240
Miss Campbell!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.650
Don't think you're special 
because everyone fawns over you!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:05.910
You were going to give the student 
council cheap food made by a commoner?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.790
These couldn't be more unfit for them!

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:10.090
Stop it!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.330
L-Lady Catarina Claes?

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:19.000
What do all of you think you're doing?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.510
<i>What have they done 
to Maria-chan's homemade sweets?</i>

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.100
<i>Such a crime... is unforgivable!</i>

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.520
W-We're so sorry!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.770
<i>Having the face 
of a villainess paid off bigtime.</i>

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:39.370
But, gosh...

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.370
These smell so good!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.450
Delicious!

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:53.160
<i>It's gentle on the tongue 
and has the perfect level of sweetness!</i>

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.920
<i>This would rank among 
the best sweets in history!</i>

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.870
I'm stuffed!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:12.110
<i>O-Oh, no!</i>

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:15.230
<i>I got carried away and ate them all!</i>

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.710
I-I'm sorry!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:20.630
No, I don't mind that...

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.210
It's just that those were on the ground...

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:25.300
They only fell onto the grass.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.230
They were hardly dirty at all, 
so there's no problem!

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.820
I-I see...

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:31.850
But really,

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:36.380
these are just as good 
as anything a professional would make!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.920
They were delicious!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.090
Thank you.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.280
<i>Sh-She's so cute!</i>

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:46.510
<i>No wonder she's an otome game heroine!</i>

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.640
<i>This would make anyone's heart skip a beat!</i>

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.390
So this is where you've been.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.310
What are you doing?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.190
Catarina?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.020
U-Um...

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.150
<b>Extra Strong Fertilizer</b>

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:07.360
<i>I had no idea Maria-chan 
was being bullied like that.</i>

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.450
Ugh! They're so mean!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.580
They're just like Catarina in the game!

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:12.770
Wait...

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:16.790
Come to think of it, there was 
a scene like that in the game...

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:18.670
Oh! She's remembered!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.700
The one who bullied Maria 
in the game was Catarina!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:24.690
And the one who defended Maria was him.

00:21:24.690 --> 00:21:25.500
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.560
<i>These are truly delicious!</i>

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.210
He's the best!

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:36.770
This was a major event in the advancement 
of Geordo and Maria's romance in the game.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:40.520
But the one who actually defended Maria 
and ate the sweets was...

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:44.030
We took Geordo's event away from him!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:47.150
Now their romance won't make any progress.

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:49.250
It's better if it doesn't!

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:52.940
If things work out between them, 
Catarina is doomed!

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:54.490
Y-You're right...

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:59.460
How truly splendid that she broke her 
doom flag without meaning to.

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:02.220
Well done! Way to go, Catarina!

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:03.460
Yeah!

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:05.320
All right!

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.470
I'll keep working my tail off!
